OL,3,GNEWSASocial tenants frustrated by
OL,4,Adelays for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA social housing tenant whose home has
OL,7,Fdamp and cracks in the wall has said
OL,8,Fshe has "given up" asking for help
OL,9,Fafter waiting months for issues to be
OL,10,Ffixed.
OL,12,FMother-of-one Shannon Shell and her
OL,13,Fpartner Declan Askew said they had
OL,14,Fexperienced a series of problems at
OL,15,Ftheir property in the estate in St
OL,16,FPeter Port, Guernsey.
OL,18,F"You give up about it because you know
OL,19,Fit's going to take forever," said
OL,20,FShell, adding: "They don't help."
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
